n: 4.1.2.3
name: go-gc-waits-for-jit-code
kind: observation
is: With the main goroutine inside a foreign arm64 loop that ran 679 ms, a runtime.GC() requested 50 ms in returned after 627 ms, the rest of the loop. With the same loop compiled by Go (777 ms) the collection returned after 0.31 ms. GOMAXPROCS was 16, Go 1.27.2, M4 Max.
