is: Rust's pages say naked functions are stable since 1.88.0 of 2025-06-26, with no compiler-generated prologue or epilogue; symbol and section control comes from no_mangle, export_name and link_section; the current release on 2026-11-24 was 1.100.0 of 2026-11-12.
