is: wazero's rationale quotes Apple: 'Apple does not support statically linked binaries on Mac OS X', and says Go on darwin always uses "CGO" mechanisms in its runtime layer, whatever CGO_ENABLED is. Every binary the study measured, pure Go with cgo off included, links libSystem, and the old body's Mach-O emitter relies on ld to link and sign ad hoc.
